#. ja: パンプキンクッキー2019
#. de: Kürbiskeks[p] 2019
#. fr: biscuit citrouille 2019
#. column 2: old pumpkin cookies MMXIX
#. column 8: A devilish─though, admittedly, industrious─imp is thought to have made this slightly burnt biscuit shaped like a pumpkin head. One can only wonder what ingredients it contains, but as the people of Eorzea have been consuming these for years now with no ill effects beyond mild disappointment, they're probably not <i>too</i> horrific.
#. column 9: Old Pumpkin Cookie MMXIX
msgctxt "Item:27231:0:0"
msgid "old pumpkin cookie MMXIX"
msgstr "Старое тыквенное печенье MMXIX"

#. de: Kürbiskekse[p] 2019
#. fr: biscuits citrouille 2019
#. column 0: old pumpkin cookie MMXIX
