msgid "Blade of Early Antiquity"
msgstr "Клинок древности"

#. ja: 黒影の強化薬
#. de: Fläschchen[p] Dunkelschatten-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant ombrobscur
#. column 2: flasks of deepshadow solvent
#. column 8: A clever alchemical potion concocted through the combined efforts of craftspeople from the Crystalline Mean's various facets. When applied in carefully measured amounts, it removes imperfections invisible to the naked eye from deepshadow weapons, thereby enhancing their more desirable attributes. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Deepshadow Solvent
msgctxt "Item:27405:0:0"
msgid "flask of deepshadow solvent"
msgstr "склянка растворителя глубинной тени"

#. de: Fläschchen[p] Dunkelschatten-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fioles d'agent renforçant ombrobscur
#. column 0: flask of deepshadow solvent
#. column 8: A clever alchemical potion concocted through the combined efforts of craftspeople from the Crystalline Mean's various facets. When applied in carefully measured amounts, it removes imperfections invisible to the naked eye from deepshadow weapons, thereby enhancing their more desirable attributes. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Deepshadow Solvent
msgctxt "Item:27405:0:2"
msgid "flasks of deepshadow solvent"
msgstr "склянки растворителя глубинной тени"

#. ja: ミーン工芸館が作り出した錬金薬。<br>ディープシャドウ武器の強化に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【武器】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Ein in der Manufaktur der Gemeinschaft hergestelltes Lösungsmittel, das die Eigenschaften von Dunkelschatten-Waffen verstärkt. Früher ein begehrtes Gut, doch die Technologie hat sich inzwischen weiterentwickelt und das Lösungsmittel ist quasi nutzlos geworden.
#. fr: Une mixture alchimique provenant de la halle du Juste. Elle permettait autrefois d'améliorer l'efficacité des armes de la Pleine-ombre. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise pour ça aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: flask of deepshadow solvent
#. column 2: flasks of deepshadow solvent
#. column 9: Deepshadow Solvent
msgctxt "Item:27405:0:8"
msgid "A clever alchemical potion concocted through the combined efforts of craftspeople from the Crystalline Mean's various facets. When applied in carefully measured amounts, it removes imperfections invisible to the naked eye from deepshadow weapons, thereby enhancing their more desirable attributes. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Хитроумное алхимическое зелье, созданное совместными усилиями мастеров разных отделов Кристального центра. Если точно отмерить нужное количество, оно убирает с оружия глубинной тени невидимые глазу изъяны и усиливает его лучшие свойства. Но с развитием ремесленных технологий оно устарело."

#. ja: 黒影の強化薬
