#. de: Phiole[p] Dunkelschatten-Poliermittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent solidifiant ombrobscur
#. column 2: phials of deepshadow coating
#. column 8: This viscous concoction, devised through the combined efforts of craftspeople from the Crystalline Mean's various facets, can be used to seal deepshadow accessories with a lustrous stygian coating that enhances their attributes. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Deepshadow Coating
msgctxt "Item:27407:0:0"
msgid "phial of deepshadow coating"
msgstr "флакон покрытия глубинной тени"

