#. ja: アラガントームストーン:幻想を納品した証となる商人モーエンの手形だった紙切れ。<br>引き換え期限が終了し、今や取引には利用できない
#. de: Von Mowen für die Abgabe Allagischer Steine der Phantasmagorie ausgegebene Bestätigungsmarke. Der Handel mit diesen Marken wurde beendet. Sie können daher nicht mehr eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Cet avoir atteste que vous avez remis à Mowen des mémoquartz allagois fantasmagoriques. Il pouvait être échangé contre des équipements de grande qualité, mais n'est désormais plus valable.
#. column 0: Mowen's token (phantasmagoria)
#. column 2: Mowen's tokens (phantasmagoria)
#. column 9: Mowen's Token (Phantasmagoria)
msgctxt "Item:27408:0:8"
msgid "A note of promise received from Mowen for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of phantasmagoria. However, due to the Boutique of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed."
msgstr "Обещание Моуэн в обмен на аллаганские камни фантазии. Но Бутик великолепия сменил правила, и теперь эта бумажка не стоит и чернил, которыми написана."

#. ja: モーエンの手形:幻想
#. de: Mowen-Marke „Phantasmagorie“
#. fr: Avoir de Mowen (fantasmagorique)
#. column 0: Mowen's token (phantasmagoria)
#. column 2: Mowen's tokens (phantasmagoria)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Mowen for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of phantasmagoria. However, due to the Boutique of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
msgctxt "Item:27408:0:9"
msgid "Mowen's Token (Phantasmagoria)"
msgstr "Талон Моуэн (фантазия)"

#. ja: 超薄型トームストーン
#. de: ultraflach[a] Stein
#. fr: mémoquartz ultrafin
#. column 2: lightweight tomestones
#. column 8: As the popular saying attests, “Knowledge is power,” though librarians will also claim, “Knowledge is heavy,” which is perhaps the reason why the Allagans developed this exceedingly thin means of storing data. Unfortunately, these tomestones are rather prone to being bent or snapped, and it is believed that many have fallen victim to the posteriors of careless scholars. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Lightweight Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:27409:0:0"
msgid "lightweight tomestone"
msgstr "лёгкий том"

#. de: ultraflach[a] Steine
#. fr: mémoquartz ultrafins
#. column 0: lightweight tomestone
#. column 8: As the popular saying attests, “Knowledge is power,” though librarians will also claim, “Knowledge is heavy,” which is perhaps the reason why the Allagans developed this exceedingly thin means of storing data. Unfortunately, these tomestones are rather prone to being bent or snapped, and it is believed that many have fallen victim to the posteriors of careless scholars. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Lightweight Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:27409:0:2"
msgid "lightweight tomestones"
msgstr "лёгкие тома"

#. ja: 古代の記憶が記されたアラグ文明の遺物。心配になるほど薄っぺらい。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ein Relikt, das Wissen über das antike Reich der Allager enthält. Der flache Stein wirkt außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>lich ästhetisch, doch neigt er mehr als seine Vorgängermodelle dazu, dem unvorsichtigen Benutzer aus der Hand zu rutschen und zu Bruch zu gehen. Einst rissen sich Sammler förmlich nach dieser Rarität, doch heutzutage findet man dafür keine Abnehmer mehr.
#. fr: Cette pierre, vestige de la civilisation allagoise, renferme des con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ces ancestrales. Elle est si fine qu'on aurait peur de la casser. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: lightweight tomestone
#. column 2: lightweight tomestones
#. column 9: Lightweight Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:27409:0:8"
msgid "As the popular saying attests, “Knowledge is power,” though librarians will also claim, “Knowledge is heavy,” which is perhaps the reason why the Allagans developed this exceedingly thin means of storing data. Unfortunately, these tomestones are rather prone to being bent or snapped, and it is believed that many have fallen victim to the posteriors of careless scholars. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares."
msgstr "Как гласит народная мудрость, «знание — сила». Библиотекари же скажут: «знание — тяжкий груз». Возможно, поэтому аллаганцы и изобрели этот необычайно тонкий способ хранения данных. Увы, такие тома легко согнуть или сломать, и, говорят, многие пострадали от неосторожных учёных, которые на них садились. Эта разновидность уже не так популярна, как прежде, и обменять её на другие товары больше нельзя."

#. ja: 超薄型トームストーン
#. de: Ultraflacher Stein
#. fr: Mémoquartz ultrafin
